# Cursor entry point

Read `AGENTS.md` and `README-HANDOFF.md` before doing anything in this project.

Codex/ChatGPT, Claude and Cursor all edit this same repository (including
theming) and share ONE handoff document. **Every time** you change anything:

1. Update `README-HANDOFF.md` (date, assistant, what changed, tests actually
   run, what was NOT verified, exact next step).
2. Commit and `git push origin master`.
3. **Tell the user in your reply** that the handoff was updated and pushed -
   always, even for a small change.

This repository is PUBLIC: never commit secrets, real shop data, or binaries
(exes go on GitHub Releases only).

Do not copy the shared rules into another Cursor rule. This file is a pointer;
`AGENTS.md` is the single source of truth.
